        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Outthink. Outlast. Outplay.</strong><br><br>Step into a tactical roguelike where every battle is a puzzle, every move matters, and defeat is just the start of the story! Assemble your team of unique idiots and fight through 4 dangerous regions — each with its own enemies, gimmicks, and secrets... From goblin ambushes in dense forests to mind-bending traps in a forgotten library, every encounter forces you to adapt your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Chess with Idiots is a turn based strategy roguelike. You control a self made team of 'Idiots' with the goal of completing as many runs as possible. A run starts at the forest and ends at the final boss on top of the volcano. Finishing a run allows you to either continue, or completely end your run. If you decide to continue, you restart at the forest but will notice that all the enemies have become a lot stronger...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom turn order -</strong> Determine the order of actions yourself and create the optimal strategy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946970/extras/43a6b28a90948adee8fd050aad7b1e47.poster.avif?t=1761929981\" width=402 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946970/extras/43a6b28a90948adee8fd050aad7b1e47.webm?t=1761929981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946970/extras/43a6b28a90948adee8fd050aad7b1e47.mp4?t=1761929981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four Distinct Regions</strong> – Forest, Cave, Library, and Volcano — each with unique visuals, challenges, and bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946970/extras/e7c8867f6ad35f863b3f01ecd0e11c28.avif?t=1761929981\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946970/extras_big/e7c8867f6ad35f863b3f01ecd0e11c28.webp?t=1761929981 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike Progression</strong> – Unlock new characters, abilities, and strategies with each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946970/extras/47584f573f7163191b6f13dcfebcce5d.avif?t=1761929981\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946970/extras_big/47584f573f7163191b6f13dcfebcce5d.webp?t=1761929981 width=1560 height=879 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Encounters</strong> – No two battles play out the same thanks to randomized enemy setups.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Hazards</strong> – Lava flows, collapsing tiles, magical anomalies, and more keep the battlefield alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946970/extras/06acbae10e71a5a2c25fab02d8a5a3b1.poster.avif?t=1761929981\" width=188 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946970/extras/06acbae10e71a5a2c25fab02d8a5a3b1.webm?t=1761929981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946970/extras/06acbae10e71a5a2c25fab02d8a5a3b1.mp4?t=1761929981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Handcrafted 2D Art &amp; Effects</strong> – Colorful environments and smooth animations bring each region to life.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Will you conquer the dragon at the heart of the volcano… or become just another hero swallowed by the flames?</strong></i><br><br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DISCLAIMER</strong>! This game is not a variant of chess, it is it's own concept but influenced by the game of chess.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Outthink. Outlast. Outplay.</strong><br><br>Step into a tactical roguelike where every battle is a puzzle, every move matters, and defeat is just the start of the story! Assemble your team of unique idiots and fight through 4 dangerous regions — each with its own enemies, gimmicks, and secrets... From goblin ambushes in dense forests to mind-bending traps in a forgotten library, every encounter forces you to adapt your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Chess with Idiots is a turn based strategy roguelike. You control a self made team of 'Idiots' with the goal of completing as many runs as possible. A run starts at the forest and ends at the final boss on top of the volcano. Finishing a run allows you to either continue, or completely end your run. If you decide to continue, you restart at the forest but will notice that all the enemies have become a lot stronger...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom turn order -</strong> Determine the order of actions yourself and create the optimal strategy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946970/extras/43a6b28a90948adee8fd050aad7b1e47.poster.avif?t=1761929981\" width=402 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946970/extras/43a6b28a90948adee8fd050aad7b1e47.webm?t=1761929981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946970/extras/43a6b28a90948adee8fd050aad7b1e47.mp4?t=1761929981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four Distinct Regions</strong> – Forest, Cave, Library, and Volcano — each with unique visuals, challenges, and bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946970/extras/e7c8867f6ad35f863b3f01ecd0e11c28.avif?t=1761929981\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946970/extras_big/e7c8867f6ad35f863b3f01ecd0e11c28.webp?t=1761929981 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike Progression</strong> – Unlock new characters, abilities, and strategies with each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946970/extras/47584f573f7163191b6f13dcfebcce5d.avif?t=1761929981\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946970/extras_big/47584f573f7163191b6f13dcfebcce5d.webp?t=1761929981 width=1560 height=879 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Encounters</strong> – No two battles play out the same thanks to randomized enemy setups.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Hazards</strong> – Lava flows, collapsing tiles, magical anomalies, and more keep the battlefield alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946970/extras/06acbae10e71a5a2c25fab02d8a5a3b1.poster.avif?t=1761929981\" width=188 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946970/extras/06acbae10e71a5a2c25fab02d8a5a3b1.webm?t=1761929981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946970/extras/06acbae10e71a5a2c25fab02d8a5a3b1.mp4?t=1761929981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Handcrafted 2D Art &amp; Effects</strong> – Colorful environments and smooth animations bring each region to life.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Will you conquer the dragon at the heart of the volcano… or become just another hero swallowed by the flames?</strong></i><br><br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DISCLAIMER</strong>! This game is not a variant of chess, it is it's own concept but influenced by the game of chess.</p>",
